  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0: COMPLETE PRODUCTION-READY E-COMMERCE FRAMEWORK! Added Saga/Process Manager infrastructure, Read Model Projections with MongoDB, comprehensive FluentValidation pipeline with RFC 7807 Problem Details, enhanced API versioning with Swagger/OpenAPI documentation, complete localization framework with Money/Currency value objects, sophisticated Domain Events with Integration Events layering, Search & Analytics abstractions for Elasticsearch/ClickHouse, unified Storage abstraction for S3/Azure Blob/GCS, advanced Security hardening with Data Protection and CSP, global Auditing & Soft-delete filters, Background jobs integration with Hangfire/Quartz, enhanced Configuration & Secrets management with strongly-typed options, comprehensive DevEx tools including templates and Directory.Packages.props, plus e-commerce domain modules for Cargo/Payment/Fraud. Complete enterprise ecosystem for production-ready microservices following Clean Architecture and SOLID principles!",
